const AQ_RULES = [['Volume negates luck', 'More attempts, more wins. Judge yourself on inputs you control.'], ['Rule of 100', '100 outreach actions a day for 100 days. Judge the input, not early results.'], ['Core Four', 'Only four ways to get attention. Pick one; founders learn sales first.'], ['Nobody knows you exist', 'Under $1M, spend the first four hours of every day getting attention.'], ['One product, one avatar, one channel', 'To six figures. Then consistent. Then add.'], ['One thing, all in', 'Saying no to good options is how you win the great one.'], ['Ignore the shiny object', 'New opportunities look best exactly when the current one gets hard.'], ['Value Equation', 'Bigger outcome, more certain, faster, less effort. Then price on that value.'], ['Grand Slam Offer', 'Every obstacle → a named solution → stacked so no feels foolish.'], ['Charge more, deliver more', 'If nobody pushes back on price, it is too low.'], ['"Can\'t afford it" = "don\'t see the value"', 'Fixing that is the seller\'s job.'], ['Start free, then raise', 'Free clients pay in proof. Then raise 20% every five sales.'], ['Proof beats promise', 'Proof only has to look like the prospect.'], ['Free or full price', 'Never a discount to close.'], ['CLOSER', 'Clarify, Label, Overview past pain, Sell the vacation, Explain concerns, Reinforce.'], ['Objections are obstacles', 'Solve them together. Nobody can argue with a question.'], ['Sales skill = reps', 'Thousands of conversations, daily role-play, review your calls.'], ['Speed to lead', 'Respond in minutes. Many sales die because nobody called back.'], ['LTGP : CAC ≥ 3 : 1', 'What a customer is worth vs what it costs to get one.'], ['Client-financed acquisition', 'Design the first 30 days so the customer pays for the next one.'], ['Fix the leaky bucket', 'Onboarding, early wins, retention, referrals before more leads.'], ['More, Better, New', 'In that order.'], ['Find the constraint', 'One thing limits growth now. Fix it, then the next.'], ['Learning = changed behaviour', 'Same situation, same action: nothing learned. Do, don\'t consume.'], ['Patience is a behaviour', 'Do the obvious thing for an unusually long time.']];
const AQ_SIT = [['I\'m not making my calls', 'Do only the task you set out to do. Real work starts when motivation ends.', 'Dial now until the block ends.'], ['I don\'t feel motivated', 'Waiting for passion is procrastination. Dissatisfaction is valid fuel.', 'Start the next dial block on time.'], ['I\'m afraid of the first call', 'Rejection tolerance is learnable. A no is the price of a yes.', '10 dials in the next 20 minutes.'], ['I keep changing the offer', 'Switching resets you to uninformed optimism. Stay long enough to learn.', 'Run the current offer for 100 more conversations.'], ['I want to fix the script first', 'You already know what to do. 100 calls teach more than 100 videos.', 'Dial; edit in Script Lab after the block.'], ['Owner says "send me info"', 'Info is an obstacle: clear it, book the next meeting before hanging up.', 'Ask which case to build it around; BAMFAM.'], ['Owner says "let me think"', 'That\'s avoidance. Ask the main concern; confirm it works, they trust you, they can fund it.', '"What information do you still need to decide?"'], ['Price objection', 'They don\'t see the value. Rebuild it: bigger, surer, faster, easier. Never discount.', 'Change the plan, never the number.'], ['"I have to ask my partner"', 'Ask what happens if they say no; ask for support, not permission.', 'Book both of them for 10 minutes.'], ['"We already have a recruiter"', 'Every position has an edge: with you they get the founder\'s phone.', '"How many of those interviews actually show up?"'], ['No-shows on calls', 'Small preference question before; remind at 24 h, morning of, 1 h before, personally.', 'Pull bookings into today.'], ['Not enough pick-ups', 'Track list quality and pick-up rate first; fresh hand-built lists win.', 'Change the call time window for one week.'], ['How many calls do I need?', 'Work backwards: revenue → clients → conversations → dials a day.', 'Check Leads → engaged leads per 100 dials.'], ['First 5 customers', 'Free in exchange for use, feedback, and a review if earned. Cap at ~5.', 'First Hire Free, five agencies.'], ['When to raise prices', 'After 10–20 case studies, +20% every five sales until price × conversion falls.', 'Founding 5 first.'], ['Should I add channels?', 'One channel to six figures. Then add.', 'Phone only until the first paying agency.'], ['Should I hire?', 'Do the job yourself until you know what good looks like.', 'Not before gate 5.'], ['I feel overwhelmed', 'One-week time audit in 15-minute blocks; cut until only the work is left.', 'Today: dials, BAC, training. Nothing else.'], ['Everything is a priority', 'One constraint now. Park the rest.', 'Write the constraint at the top of Courses → Scaling.'], ['My habits slip', 'Start the habit when you\'re busiest so it survives. Measure the committed actions.', 'Never 0: the minimum day.'], ['Burnout', 'It comes when the reward stops. Make the reward show up more often.', 'Log every booked call the moment it happens.'], ['Comparing myself to others', 'Use comparison to find gaps, never to judge your worth.', 'One thing they do that you don\'t: do it this week.'], ['I feel behind', 'Accept not being rich for nine years of a decade. Don\'t quit, don\'t switch.', 'Today\'s dials. That\'s it.'], ['I\'m spending more than I earn', 'Wealth is earn vs need. Cut for a season.', 'Money → Wealth → Margin.'], ['First money: invest it?', 'Use the first $10k to learn a skill that raises active income.', 'Wealth: O before N.'], ['I watch videos instead of working', 'Consuming isn\'t learning. Do I need information, or execution?', 'Close this. Dial.'], ['I failed this week', '"X doesn\'t work" → "I don\'t know how to make X work yet."', 'Write the one change for next week.']];
